; The tuning harness for levels/asteroid_level/intro/elevator_intro.tscn.
;
; THE SAME SUB-SCENE THE LEVEL INSTANCES, at the origin instead of against the
; mine mouth's back wall. Everything the shot is composed against travels with
; it, so this scene holds only what a director needs and a level must not have:
; a greybox tunnel beyond the doors, a shaft environment, the replay key, and
; the tuning panel.
;
; The panel's CanvasLayer sits above the intro's own (layer 30) or the opening
; full-screen shot would cover the one surface a director needs while the thing
; they are tuning is playing.

